@title Cabinet: the problems pill names its problem on hover; "duct heat" finds the heat run
@area Cabinet
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
# The chip sits at x 345 at 1366 wide and at x 595 at 1920 (the pages panel is pinned there): hover both spots, the tooltip is in one of the pictures.
move 345 96
wait 40
shot pill-hover-narrow
move 595 96
wait 40
shot pill-hover-wide
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text duct heat
wait 6
shot duct-heat
expect "Simulate heat of the cabinet"
